         measured: at kappa = 1e5 with the onset held at z = 940 the deviation stays large because the enhancement phase is retained; linked, the onset moves to z = 4848, before the integration starts, and the enhancement phase does not occur at all
         reading : the two are one quantity, not two. Scanning them separately made a larger reach look useless; linking them shows it is the whole fix. Recorded because this lane got it wrong first

